HeatBalW                      Total heat flux for surface water (Wflow)         
HEATF2    ; module name
123       ; TRswitch
        27; # input items for segments
Rad            -999.000     x actual irradiation at the segment upper-boundary       (W/m2)              
fReflSW        0.500000E-01 x Reflection factor for Qsw                              (-)                 
Cloud          -999.000     x Cloud coverage                                         (%)                 
SWEmiss         1.00000     x Switch for calculation of emissivity                   (-)                 
Tempair         15.0000     x Air temperature                                        (degC)              
SBC            0.567000E-07 x StefanBolzman Constant                                 (W/m2/K-4)          
fReflA         0.300000E-01 x Reflection factor for Qa                               (-)                 
EmissWat       0.970000     x Emissivity (colour factor) of surface water            (-)                 
NatTemp        -999.000     x Background water temperature                           (oC)                
RhoWat0         1000.00     x density of water at 4oC                                (kg/m3)             
CwindA          4.40000     x Coefficient in wind function a                         (-)                 
CwindB          1.82000     x Coefficient in wind function b                         (-)                 
CwindC          0.00000     x Coefficient in wind function c                         (-)                 
Vwind          -999.000     x wind speed                                             (m/s)               
Hwindm          10.0000     x Height at which wind speed is measured                 (m)                 
Hwinda          10.0000     x Height of wind speed needed for wind function          (m)                 
Ctauwind       0.500000E-01 x Roughness coef for calculation vwind                   (-)                 
cpa             1005.00     x Specific heat capacity of air                          (J/kg,K)            
PAtm            1000.00     x Air pressure                                           (mbar)              
RadRB           0.00000       Heat exchange between water and riverbed               (W/m2)              
CP              4183.00     x specific heat of water                                 (J/kg/oC)           
Depth          -999.000     x depth of segment                                       (m)                 
RelHumAir       80.0000     x Relative air humidity                                  (%)                 
CorrTemp1D      0.00000       Correction of temperature near discharge 1D            (oC)                
TempWref        15.0000     x Reference water temperature for wind function          (oC)                
SwitchTemp      1.00000     x switch Mod-Nat 0=Tot-Nat 1=Sur-Nat 2=Sur-Tot           (-)                 
MinDepthT      0.500000E-01 x minimal depth for heatflux calculation                 (m)                 
         0; # input items for exchanges
        13; # output items for segments
RadSN                       x non refl. (net) short wave rad. reaching wat           (W/m2)              
Psvap                       x saturated vapour pressure in air                       (mbar)              
EmissAtm                    x Emissivity (colour factor) for the atmosphere          (-)                 
RadAN                       x non refl. (net) atm long wave rad. reach wat           (W/m2)              
RadBR                       x Long wave back radiation from water                    (W/m2)              
RadLat                      x Latent heat flux by evaporation or cond.               (W/m2)              
HtCond                      x sensible heat of conduction                            (W/m2)              
HtTot                       x Total heat flux                                        (W/m2)              
PvapWa                      x sat vapour pressure at water-air interface             (mbar)              
VWinda                      x Calculated wind speed                                  (m/s)               
Vevap                       x Evaporation rate                                       (m/s)               
RhoWater                    x density of water                                       (kg/m3)             
ModTemp                     x Water Temperature                                      (oC)                
         0; # output items for exchanges
         1; # fluxes
dTempHtfl                   x Flux on water temperature via heat balance             (oC/d)              
         1; # stoichiometry lines
NatTemp     dTempHtfl      1.00000
         0; # stoichiometry lines dispersion arrays
         0; # stoichiometry lines velocity arrays
END
